WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Every fact in the report carries a reference.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.800
They look like this, beside the sentence.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:17.200
Clicking one opens the source.

4
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.100
The page, the sentence it came from, and when it was read.

5
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.300
The last section lists every page read.

6
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:33.700
One page could not be read.

7
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:38.600
The site does not allow it, so the link is given instead.

8
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.800
Asking questions is next.
